// Shared development container. Deliberately AGENT-NEUTRAL: it installs no
// coding agent, so nothing here is imposed on teammates who use a different
// one. Provisioning lives in scripts/ -- see README "Dev container" and
// design/0012.
//
// Personal additions (e.g. a coding agent and its persistent volumes) go in
// .devcontainer/personal/devcontainer.json, which is gitignored. A tracked
// example is provided.
{
  "name": "Research",

  "image": "mcr.microsoft.com/devcontainers/base:ubuntu",

  "remoteUser": "vscode",

  "postCreateCommand": "bash scripts/setup-tools.sh"
}
